  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of support to UNIFEM&apos;s programme &quot;Women for Conflict Prevention and Peace Buildning in Southern Caucasus&quot;. The overall objective is to enable the development of a transformative peace agenda in S Caucasus, which ensures the protection of women&apos;s rights. The activities focus on ensuring that women&apos;s organisations etc have the skills and opportunity to advocate for women&apos;s rights.</narrative>
  </description>
